| `KL1L2A` | `7/3 ≤ r ≤ 67/27` | `L1 = L2` | `L1` at the kink |
| `KL1L2B` | `67/27 ≤ r ≤ 53/21` | `L1 = L2` | `L1` at the kink |
| `KL247` | `17/7 ≤ r ≤ 53/21` | `L2 = 4b/7` | `4b/7` |
| `KL147A` | `53/21 ≤ r ≤ 19/7` | `L1 = 4b/7` | `4b/7` |
